sted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fb3b69538a0ee780f11517c019]\n听风: kimiclaw 里如何配置 lark 应用","itemLifecycle":{"startedCount":4,"completedCount":4,"activeCount":0},"toolMetas":[{"toolName":"exec","meta":"find files named \"*.md\" in /app/docs -> show first 20 lines (+1 steps), `find /app/docs -type f -name \"*.md\" | xargs grep -l -i \"lark\\|feishu\\|kimi\" 2>/dev/null | head -20`"},{"toolName":"web_search","meta":"for \"kimiClaw lark feishu 配置 教程\""},{"toolName":"web_fetch","meta":"from https://www.kimi.com/zh-cn/help/kimi-claw/feishu-bot (max 8000 chars)"}],"didSendViaMessagingTool":false,"successfulCronAdds":0,"messagingToolSentTexts":[],"messagingToolSentMediaUrls":[],"messagingToolSentTargets":[]}}
